# Build context is the repo root (docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .). Keep it lean.
.git
**/node_modules
client/dist
client/.vite
server/graphite-meter
server/internal/static/dist
**/.DS_Store
the-next-step-will-harmonic-harp.md
.claude

# Never send local TLS material to the image builder.
**/.dev-certs
**/certs
**/certificates
**/letsencrypt
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.der
**/*.csr
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pkcs8
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
